hadiths[22]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3883","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman ki gumshuda cheez aag ki jalan hai."
"3884","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dumbi ke jaz'a ki qurbani karo; kyunke ye jaiz hai."
"3885","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah do aadmiyon par hansa jin mein se aik ne doosre ko qatl kiya aur donon jannat mein hain."
"3886","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main aisi qaum par hansa jinhein jannat ki taraf zanjeeron mein jakre hue hankaya jayega."
"3887","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah taala ne misaal di hai: seedha raasta; raaste ke donon pehluon par deewarein hain jin mein khule darwaze hain; darwazon par latke hue parde hain; raaste ke darwaze par pukarne wala kehta hai: Ae logon, sab raaste mein dakhil ho jao aur terh mat chalo. Aur pukarne wala raaste ke upar se pukarta hai; phir jab insaan un darwazon mein se koi kholna chahe to kehta hai: Tujh par afsos, ise na khol; kyunke agar tune use khola to us mein dakhil hoga. Pas raasta Islam hai, deewarein Allah taala ki hudood hain, khule darwaze Allah taala ki haraam-karda cheezein hain; aur wo pukarne wala jo raaste ke sar par hai Allah ki kitaab hai; aur upar se pukarne wala har musalman ke dil mein Allah ka naseehat karne wala hai."
"3888","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kafir ki daarh Uhud jaise hai aur us ki khaal ki motayi Jabbar ke haath se chaalees haath hai."
"3889","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kafir ki daarh Uhud jaise hai aur us ki khaal ki motayi teen ki musafat hai."
"3890","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din kafir ki daarh Uhud jaise hogi, us ki khaal ki chaudayi sattar haath hogi, us ka baazu Baida jaise hoga, us ki raan Warqan jaise hogi, aur aag mein us ki baithak mere aur Rabza ke darmiyan jitni hogi."
"3891","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din kafir ki daarh Uhud jaise hogi, us ki raan Baida jaise hogi, aur aag mein us ki baithak Rabza jaise teen ki musafat hogi."
"3892","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni naak rakho taake wo tumhare saath sajda kare."
"3893","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apna haath apne jism ke us hisse par rakho jo dukhta hai aur kaho: Bismillah, teen baar; aur saat baar kaho: Main Allah aur us ki qudrat ki panah mangta hun us shar se jo main pata hun aur jis se darta hun."
"3894","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apna dayan haath us jagah par rakho jis ki tum shikayat karte ho; pas us se saat baar masah karo aur kaho: Main Allah ki izzat aur us ki qudrat ki panah mangta hun us shar se jo main pata hun, har masah mein."
"3895","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Miskeen ke haath mein rakho chahe jala hua khur ho."
"3896","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman ki gumshuda cheezein aag ki jalan hain."
"3897","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Gumshuda aur padi hui cheez jo tumhein mile to us ka elaan karo; na chhupao, na ghayeb karo; phir agar us ka malik mil jaye to use ada karo; warna ye Allah ka maal hai jise chahe de."
"3898","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Saanda: main use nahi khata aur na haraam karta hun."
"3899","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bijju shikar hai; pas use khao; aur us mein umar-raseeda mendha hai jab muhrim use mare."
"3900","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bijju shikar hai aur us mein mendha hai."
"3901","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mehmaan-nawazi teen din hai; pas jo zyada ho wo sadqa hai."
"3902","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mehmaan-nawazi teen din hai; pas jo zyada ho wo sadqa hai; aur har neki sadqa hai."
"3903","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mehmaan-nawazi teen din hai; pas jo us se upar ho wo neki hai."
"3904","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mehmaan-nawazi teen din hai; pas jo us ke peeche ho wo sadqa hai."
